            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The biogenesis of beige fat is poorly understood. In recent issues of Nature and Cell, Brestoff et al. (2014) and Lee et al. (2015) demonstrate that resident innate lymphoid cells in subcutaneous fat generate and activate beige adipocytes, producing thermogenesis.</AbstractText>
